OL,5,G1800 Grant Stott's Vinyl Collective
OL,6,     FOn this week's Vinyl Collective,
OL,7,     FGrant celebrates classic album
OL,8,     Fcovers. From ABBA's Arrival to
OL,9,     FNirvana's Nevermind, it's the most
OL,10,     Ficonic album artwork of all time.
OL,11,G2000 BBC Introducing in Scotland
OL,12,     FTonight's featured artist are
OL,13,     FScratchcard Wednesday, and they're
OL,14,     Fproudly flying the flag for
OL,15,     FScottish pop music. New music from
OL,16,     FKerr Mercer, The Marches and Shay
OL,17,     FO'Dowd.
OL,18,G2200 Up Late
OL,19,     FThe best company to end the day,
OL,20,     Fwith lively chat and some of your
OL,21,     Ffavourite tunes.
